      "value": "They're a visitor. Trying to see if VRChat is for them. (in theory)\nYes a lot of visitors are annoying, but they're only annoying on VRC because they're new to it and still are missing out on a lot of social faux pas to build their understanding of the game up.\nBy blocking them, you're only making VRC players look pretty toxic or princess-like.",
