      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I play aim factory with a lot of some very good players in public lobbies, so we can meet other good players. But Visitors just jumping in your face when your playing and they blocking your shots. \nAs counter argument you can say don't play in a public then, just add good players as your friend and I play a lot of time also in Friends+ worlds so we don't have the visitors but still too find good players you need to go to a public lobby and see them play :/\nSo or there must be a way to kind of make visitors invisible until they become new user, or we should get a option to make lobbies for people with a rank at least so no visitors.",
