      "value": "@{5c540514d859d512a8d1d2f9|full_name}: I like the game and I don't block every visitors just in the world 'aim factory' its annoying they blocking your shots and are going to stand in front of you. I don't take risks anymore because like 90% of those visitors are going to jump in front of you and ruining your score. I blocked over 300 visitors only in aim factory and maybe 10 in other worlds. If there just was a option to removed them of your screen until they become new user because like idk the exact number but maybe 50% of those visitors will play long enough to become a new user.\nAnd I explained it in other reaction but I want too meet other good players in aim factory and you can't just add everyone as a friend if they good. Most of the time you don't know them or they don't want to accept because they just don't know you.\nI spend a lot of time in friends+ world but a big group already that I added but you want to learn other players as well :/",
